# Regenerated evidence. `capture.mjs`, `perf.mjs` and `prompt-evidence.mjs` rewrite these frames on
# every run, so tracking them turned ten screenshots into 28 commits each and .git into 1.2 GB.
# The small JSON/MD reports in the same directories ARE tracked — they are diffable and they are the
# evidence that a claim was measured. A frame that must survive as a comparison basis is promoted by
# copying it into artifacts/evidence/baseline/, which is tracked.
artifacts/evidence/completion/**/*.png
artifacts/evidence/whole-home-reboot-final/**/*.png
artifacts/evidence/redesign-final/**/*.png
artifacts/evidence/shots/**/*.png
!artifacts/evidence/baseline/**
